# The one .a that is a dependency rather than build output: supramark's
# Mermaid/PlantUML renderers, vendored the same way 3rdparty/vl-convert's
# binary is, so the offline edition builds from a clone without needing a
# Rust toolchain. See 3rdparty/supramark/README.md for how it is produced.
